<article class="env-proposition" id="0FXM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FXM">Proposition <span data-tag="0FXM">15.81.6</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a Noetherian ring. The following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$R$ is regular of finite dimension, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$D_{perf}(R)$ has a strong generator, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$R$ is a strong generator for $D_{perf}(R)$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a formal consequence of Lemmas <a href="/tag/0ATI" data-tag="0ATI">15.80.1</a>, <a href="/tag/0FXI" data-tag="0FXI">15.81.2</a>, and <a href="/tag/0FXL" data-tag="0FXL">15.81.5</a> as well as Derived Categories, Lemma <a href="/tag/0FXA" data-tag="0FXA">13.36.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>